      "title": "Dual-Engine Architecture",
      "items": [
        "Deterministic Quant Core: 11 criteria, Graham/DCF/MoS with zero AI hallucinations",
        "Agentic AI Discovery: 5-phase research loop with Tavily web search & Gemini reasoning",
        "Master Synthesis: Aggregates >=7 discovery runs into cross-strategy portfolios"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Crash-Safe Persistence",
      "items": [
        "Storage writes use mkstemp + os.fsync + os.replace to prevent partial corruption",
        "24-hour financial statement disk cache prevents excessive yfinance API calls",
        "User theses, postmortems, and discovery runs stored locally as JSON"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Defensive Security",
      "items": [
        "Input validation: safe_join prevents path traversal across user-provided paths",
        "Strict ticker and UUID sanitizers block injection vectors",
        "Active client-disconnect detection terminates background LLM threads on drop"
      ]
    }
